{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"402138","name":"Dobedan World Palace Ex Alva Donna","description":"Boasting a beautiful location on the Mediterranean coast a short drive from the larger resort of Kemer and with the magnificent Taurus Mountains forming a back-drop, this luxurious complex is an ideal destination for families and couples. Refurbished at the beginning of 2015, the property offers a host of entertainment and relaxation amenities occupying a spacious 107, 000sqm of land. The fabulous outdoor facilities include a beautiful garden with large pools catering for the active with waterslides and for those looking for a quieter spot, a relax pool. Beach lovers can enjoy a 400m long shingle beach with its' own pier and for those guests wanting a little exclusivity, there are VIP pavilions for their pleasure. A rich choice of cuisine is served in the various restaurants in the hotel and for enjoying a relaxing drink, guests can benefit from a host of different venues.","address":"Kiriş Beldesi, Sahil, 5","city":"KEMER","countryCode":"TR","lat":36.571364,"lng":30.579386,"stars":5,"chain":"ALVAD","giataCode":"5762","phone":"00902428248526","email":"sales@alvadonna.com","website":"www.alvadonna.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/40/402138/402138a_hb_a_012.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/40/402138/402138a_hb_a_013.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/40/402138/402138a_hb_a_014.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/40/402138/402138a_hb_a_015.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/40/402138/402138a_hb_a_016.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/40/402138/402138a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/40/402138/402138a_hb_